  "factor_costs": {
    "reference": "Exact committed direct-Cohort Shared pointer driver; Cohort16B, Slot56B.",
    "sync": "Frame40B pointer Shared, ordered ready classification, ordinary synchronous fallback.",
    "tail": "Same Frame40B and ready helper, musttail cold continuation before synchronous remaining members.",
    "vector": "Same ordered Frame40B, prepared immutable facts carried as three 128-bit vector carriers plus line-size scalar; stage-specific kernels reuse facts without hardware queries.",
    "snapshot": "Mechanism control: Frame48B appends borrowed immutable operation Context pointer; native cold wrapper calls ordinary helper and reconstructs exact admitted vector carriers after it. Hot callback bodies otherwise exact vector source.",
    "slim": "Optional sixth matched mechanism control: Frame40B/Slot56B, same pointer Shared and ready helpers as tail; Cohort.advance merges ready work and completion commit. First deferred Job pointer selects cold; cold Cohort.advance skips earlier survivors and completes deferred/rest in original ascending order. Same-array pointer ordering is valid within the admitted contiguous Cohort span. No scheduler/API change, no presumed static/native speed win; red-zone/cold frame costs separately retained."
  },
